---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";

const description = "Discourse Federation is a standalone plugin for Discourse that connects Discourse forums for sharing and promoting conversations and participating in discussions locally or at their source.";
const discussionUrl = "https://forum.codeworkslabs.dev/t/discourse-federation-by-cwl-in-process-seeking-inputs/18";
---

<Base title="Discourse Federation — CodeWorksLabs" {description}>
  <section class="product-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Discourse Federation</p>
      <h1>Discourse<br /><em>Federation</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">{description}</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href={discussionUrl}>Discuss Federation and share your use case <span>↗</span></a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/products/discourse-network/">Compare Discourse Network</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="release-panel">
      <p>Product status</p><strong>In process - Seeking Inputs</strong><span>Standalone Discourse plugin</span>
      <dl><div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Discourse</dd></div><div><dt>DiscussionBridge (DB)</dt><dd>Optional</dd></div><div><dt>Maker</dt><dd>CodeWorksLabs</dd></div></dl>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="section install-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> How it fits</p><h2>Connect forums.<br /><em>Retain control.</em></h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>It works with or without DiscussionBridge installed, with membership and permissions independent of Discourse Network.</p>
      <p>Participating forums retain ownership of their content and control over access. Local replies and replies at the source are distinct, with a “Reply as” layer that includes source identity.</p>
      <p>Sharing respects each forum’s privacy; participation does not grant permission to publish another forum’s full content through DiscussionBridge or its platform adapters. ActivityPub remains optional for outward content federation.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/products/discussionbridge-activitypub/">Explore the ActivityPub questions →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section install-band">
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Help shape it</p><h2>Discovery.<br /><em>Participation.</em></h2></div>
    <div>
      <p>How forums join, discover and follow conversations, present shared discussions and make the local-versus-source participation choice clear still needs detailed definition.</p>
      <p>Describe the communities you want to connect and how participants should discover a conversation, choose where to reply and understand which identity they are using.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={discussionUrl}>Share your workflows and follow product updates →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="limitations"><strong>In process - Seeking Inputs</strong><p>The product direction is established; detailed workflows, release coverage and installation arrangements remain to be defined. This is not an announcement of a released plugin.</p></section>
</Base>
